change_log = "[b]unsubstantial 0.96 dev 8[/b] 
[i]released June 9th 2026[/i]
 - many balancing changes
 - new shards
 - added a boss
 - the enemies have animations now (wow)
 - added shops and soul (capitalism and money)
 - nerfed the dash (attack speed wont affect its cooldown and dash distance has been slightly reduced)
 - updated the crystal select screen
 - added back music (by nexiwisp, amnist and me. check them out!)
 - enemy spawning now has a cooldown and enemies cant spawn behind walls
 - updated all the maps
 - added ⊡ items"
